<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tiffany EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tiffany EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it raised its fiscal 1997 earnings estimate on Tiffany &amp; Co Inc to $1.95 a share from $1.87 a share. Also raised the 1998 estimate to $2.25 a share from $2.15 a share.</p>
<p>-- said &quot;aggressively&quot; reiterated buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Tiffany gained 1-1/4 to 38-7/8.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
